icator of cooperation, while A lacks any evidence. Also note that C's unwillingness to further education is a concern but may be mitigated with training, whereas A's unhealthy diet may affect reliability. So I will change my vote to Candidate C.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 3 that C's crew cooperation and decision quality outweigh the concerns, and I shift my recommendation to C. Provide evidence: quick correct decisions, positive crew atmosphere, concern for others, excellent attention, technical competence. Mention concerns: difficulty communicating, egocentric, not willing to further education, unknown stress resilience. Argue that these are less critical than B's cooperation deficits and A's unknowns.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
